# yumi: копия /usr/local/bin/touchbar-agent + apps_fullscreen_only (16.10). Подключена drop-in'ом
# ~/.config/systemd/user/touchbar-agent.service.d/10-yumi.conf; откат — удалить drop-in и перезапустить службу.
"""touchbar-agent: the session half of the Omarchy Touch Bar.

touchbard (a system service) owns the Touch Bar hardware. This agent runs in
your Hyprland session and feeds it everything that lives there:

  * colours from the current Omarchy theme (live, follows `omarchy theme set`)
  * the layout from ~/.config/touchbar/config.toml (live, applies on save)
  * volume, mute, screen and keyboard brightness, now playing
  * Touch ID prompts, from fprintd on the system bus

and it runs the commands behind buttons and applies slider changes.

Usage:
  touchbar-agent                  run (normally via the systemd user service)
  touchbar-agent --dump-layout    print the expanded layout as JSON
  touchbar-agent --dump-theme     print the theme message as JSON
  touchbar-agent --layer NAME     switch the bar to a layer
  touchbar-agent record [SECS] [-o FILE] [--no-audio]
                                  record the bar (and what's playing) to an
                                  MP4 in ~/Videos; run it again to stop
"""

